#09:46 < legostein> I just learned from the people at the RZ in Garching:
#09:46 < legostein> Tip of the day:
#09:46 < legostein> Btw. the module category 'visualization' is hidden by default on
#09:46 < legostein> Hydra's interactive/login nodes. To list these modules without having
#09:46 < legostein> to start a visualization session you can just say:
